WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.103
Today we will select colours intentionally. Our work connects with other Ghanaian

00:00:05.103 --> 00:00:05.512
communities.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.161
Choose three colours that suit your chosen message.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.863
Test the colours in small labelled boxes.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:19.160
Circle the most readable combination and plan where to use it. Compare your result

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.215
with a second example from Ghana.
